# House Cartographer, Survival's "if this creature is tapped" (CR 603.4): Cartographer does not attack on turn 3, so it is untapped
# at the beginning of the second main phase and nothing is revealed. The library is untouched (Bears and Elves still on top, 14
# cards after the turn 3 draw) and the Forest is still in it. The control is the scenario where Cartographer attacks first.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
House Cartographer
Island x4
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.House Cartographer.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.House Cartographer.Tapped = false
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.End]

